{"3275980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unpeaceful", "steam_appid": 3275980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Unpeaceful</strong></i><strong> is a real-time strategy game built around tactical duels and fast territorial expansion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match begins on a fragmented archipelago, a battlefield made of islands waiting to be conquered. Build bridges to expand your domain, place structures, and secure key resources</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of your forces are the <strong>Tapliki</strong>, small but determined creatures who gather resources, build your structures, and carry out every action on the field. Guiding them efficiently is key to shaping the flow of each match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map features its own economy and special events, creating shifting conditions that change how you plan, react, and execute your strategy</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a passive perk that enhances your strengths and supports the playstyle you prefer, giving every match its own strategic flavor</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But expansion comes with risk, destroy enemy bridges to cut off their supply lines and turn the tide of battle. Timing and map control are everything</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Challenge your friends or take on a dedicated single-player campaign where you confront a mysterious threat emerging from another world.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FAST AND COMPETITIVE 1v1 MATCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/511b4fde2038feff543707c50e3f8c60.webp?t=1780182311\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay your opponent in quick, tactical duels where every decision matters and every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in streamlined, accessible 1v1 battles designed to be easy to pick up while still offering meaningful strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/3d18e258d964bc1d1bf1ee12feafc241.webp?t=1780182311\" width=743 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHOOSE AND BUILD YOUR STRUCTURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/511b4fde2038feff543707c50e3f8c60.webp?t=1780182311\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/2d4e9066e37bd83fcd842cf1787af149.poster.avif?t=1780182311\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/2d4e9066e37bd83fcd842cf1787af149.webm?t=1780182311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Place structures across the islands to secure bonuses, reinforce key positions, and unlock tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/588994554ebaceae2ca3aaaedf68e6ae.webp?t=1780182311\" width=743 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CLAIM YOUR TERRITORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/511b4fde2038feff543707c50e3f8c60.webp?t=1780182311\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/0c5340721da2aedce2af10478f4f1b81.poster.avif?t=1780182311\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/0c5340721da2aedce2af10478f4f1b81.webm?t=1780182311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build bridges to seize new islands, each granting unique resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Steal enemy islands by blowing up their bridges, cutting their access, and turning their structures against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/d75797c02890190980d1bd9ced7c7081.webp?t=1780182311\" width=743 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNLEASH DIVINE POWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/511b4fde2038feff543707c50e3f8c60.webp?t=1780182311\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/b08f08a67ed2acc9e7020c40ab60ae9c.poster.avif?t=1780182311\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/b08f08a67ed2acc9e7020c40ab60ae9c.webm?t=1780182311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Call upon ancient gods to shape the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleash powerful abilities that can boost your economy, defend your surroundings, or turn an enemy’s strategy against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/17c5770bc57e7ab1ec3822b4f5b8db19.webp?t=1780182311\" width=743 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Games have always been a way to relax and not think about everyday problems.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong> But what would happen if the problems of another world were to present themselves directly in our home?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Unpeaceful</strong></i><strong> is a real-time strategy game built around tactical duels and fast territorial expansion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match begins on a fragmented archipelago, a battlefield made of islands waiting to be conquered. Build bridges to expand your domain, place structures, and secure key resources</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of your forces are the <strong>Tapliki</strong>, small but determined creatures who gather resources, build your structures, and carry out every action on the field. Guiding them efficiently is key to shaping the flow of each match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map features its own economy and special events, creating shifting conditions that change how you plan, react, and execute your strategy</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a passive perk that enhances your strengths and supports the playstyle you prefer, giving every match its own strategic flavor</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But expansion comes with risk, destroy enemy bridges to cut off their supply lines and turn the tide of battle. Timing and map control are everything</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Challenge your friends or take on a dedicated single-player campaign where you confront a mysterious threat emerging from another world.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FAST AND COMPETITIVE 1v1 MATCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/511b4fde2038feff543707c50e3f8c60.webp?t=1780182311\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay your opponent in quick, tactical duels where every decision matters and every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in streamlined, accessible 1v1 battles designed to be easy to pick up while still offering meaningful strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/3d18e258d964bc1d1bf1ee12feafc241.webp?t=1780182311\" width=743 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHOOSE AND BUILD YOUR STRUCTURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/511b4fde2038feff543707c50e3f8c60.webp?t=1780182311\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/2d4e9066e37bd83fcd842cf1787af149.poster.avif?t=1780182311\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/2d4e9066e37bd83fcd842cf1787af149.webm?t=1780182311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Place structures across the islands to secure bonuses, reinforce key positions, and unlock tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/588994554ebaceae2ca3aaaedf68e6ae.webp?t=1780182311\" width=743 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CLAIM YOUR TERRITORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/511b4fde2038feff543707c50e3f8c60.webp?t=1780182311\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/0c5340721da2aedce2af10478f4f1b81.poster.avif?t=1780182311\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/0c5340721da2aedce2af10478f4f1b81.webm?t=1780182311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build bridges to seize new islands, each granting unique resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Steal enemy islands by blowing up their bridges, cutting their access, and turning their structures against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/d75797c02890190980d1bd9ced7c7081.webp?t=1780182311\" width=743 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNLEASH DIVINE POWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/511b4fde2038feff543707c50e3f8c60.webp?t=1780182311\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/b08f08a67ed2acc9e7020c40ab60ae9c.poster.avif?t=1780182311\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/b08f08a67ed2acc9e7020c40ab60ae9c.webm?t=1780182311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Call upon ancient gods to shape the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleash powerful abilities that can boost your economy, defend your surroundings, or turn an enemy’s strategy against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/extras/17c5770bc57e7ab1ec3822b4f5b8db19.webp?t=1780182311\" width=743 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Games have always been a way to relax and not think about everyday problems.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong> But what would happen if the problems of another world were to present themselves directly in our home?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Unpeaceful is a fast-paced real-time strategy game focused on intense 1v1 duels. Expand your domain by building bridges between islands, placing structures, capturing enemy territory, and awakening ancient gods to claim victory.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian, French, German, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/0f31265f06bf66e2ed22a256be691f23395483ee/header.jpg?t=1780182311", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/5c55dcf98e82dbc6fb596173d85e100abfbf1718/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780182311", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275980/5c55dcf98e82dbc6fb596173d85e100abfbf1718/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780182311", "website": "https://www.experience10games.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 560 (4 GB VRAM)</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Experience10Games"], "publishers": ["Experience10Games"], "package_gr